# Categories API — REST Client (VS Code / Cursor extension "REST Client")
#
# Requisitos:
#   1. API en marcha → pnpm --filter api run dev
#   2. Seed con empresa demo → pnpm db:seed:dev
#   3. Login abajo → @accessToken
#
# Flujo sugerido: login → listar → crear → obtener → actualizar → desactivar/activar → eliminar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@email = prueba@ejemplo.com
@password = Password123

@categoryId = cmptvvtw300023c500j41lrjo

### Login (obtener accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Verificar contexto JWT + empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar categorías (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar categorías (búsqueda)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?q=bebidas&page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar categorías (solo activas operativamente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories?isActive=true&page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar todas las categorías activas (sin paginación — útil para selects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/all
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Crear categoría
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bebidas",
  "description": "Refrescos, jugos y agua",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Crear categoría duplicada — debe responder 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bebidas",
  "description": "Duplicado"
}

###

### Obtener categoría por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Actualizar categoría
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bebidas frías",
  "description": "Refrescos y jugos refrigerados"
}

###

### Desactivar categoría (isActive = false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Activar categoría (isActive = true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Eliminar categoría (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Crear categoría (validación — name vacío, debe fallar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

###

### Sin token — debe responder 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

###
